     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Is there a way to add a footer to a shiny dashboard?. Suppose you have the following very basic example, and you want to add a footer to `<span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">dashboardBody</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135);background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135);background-color:transparent\">)`</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135);background-color:transparent\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135);background-color:transparent\"><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:normal;white-space:normal\"></span></p><div><pre style=\"padding:9.5px;border:1px solid rgb(238,238,238);box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;border-radius:4px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(76,136,107)\">## app.R ##</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,255)\">library</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shiny</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,255)\">library</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ui</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dashboardPage</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span>\r\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,\r\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,\r\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">dashboardBody</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">server</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,255)\">function</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">output</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shinyApp</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ui</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">server</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135);background-color:transparent\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.42857;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135);background-color:transparent\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks for the help!</p></div></div>"
